flowchart TB
  Source[Dataset source and approval metadata] --> Manifest[Prepared split manifest and hashes]
  Manifest -. training pending .-> Adapter[Candidate adapter artifact]
  Base[Base identifier and revision] --> Candidate[Immutable candidate manifest]
  Adapter --> Candidate
  Eval[Held-out report and config hashes] --> Candidate
  Candidate --> Registry[File-based registry directory]
  Registry -. reviewed manual configuration .-> Active[One active backend and model]
  Active --> Runs[PostgreSQL inference_runs / safe assistant metadata]
